": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "无", "hook_delivered": null, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-21 08:40", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-22 20:55", "signal_hint": "积极", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 4, "updates_applied": 1}], "memory_off": false, "flags": {"action_layer": true, "evidence_memory": true}, "mem": {"facts": {"f_0001": {"fact_id": "f_0001", "text": "冯其琛在职期间考过两次证，摸出一套'每日复盘十五分钟'的法子：当天错题只记关键词，第二天早上先复述再翻答案。他在自习室三楼靠里侧的固定座，习惯早到。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0002": {"fact_id": "f_0002", "text": "岑晚风二战考研，目标学校在临州，一模是她和两个研友自己组卷互改的。她原坐三楼靠窗固定座，窗外那条路正在修路。初试排在十二月。", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0003": {"fact_id": "f_0003", "text": "同层搭子三个月，互相占过座、分过宵夜，会为'谁多背了半小时'斗嘴，没聊过各自家里的事。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:warmth", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0004": {"fact_id": "f_0004", "text": "称呼冯哥，说话短，爱用数字交代安排，情绪上头时反而更简短。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:style", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0005": {"fact_id": "f_0005", "text": "冯其琛，在职考过两次证、说话直接但稳、作息规律", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0006": {"fact_id": "f_0006", "text": "岑晚风，二战考研中、嘴硬心细、习惯把情绪压成日程，底线：不爱被过度安慰、没做完的事不许人替她下结论", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0007": {"fact_id": "f_0007", "text": "她一模政治选择错十一个，英语阅读错六个", "subject": "HER", "relation": "一模成绩", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["政治选择错了十一个，英语阅读错了六个"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-09", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 21:16", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 21:16", "history": []}, "f_0008": {"fact_id": "f_0008", "text": "她说离初试还有四十来天", "subject": "HER", "relation": "备考进度", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["四十来天，接着背就是了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 21:16", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 21:16", "history": []}, "f_0009": {"fact_id": "f_0009", "text": "她跟管理员老关说好这两天挪到冯其琛隔壁里侧的空座，原因是靠窗那条路在修路，背政治容易走神", "subject": "HER", "relation": "自习座位调整", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["跟管理员老关说好了，我这两天挪到你隔壁里侧那个空座"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "tentative", "event_time": "2026-11-09前后两天", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 21:16", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 21:16", "history": []}, "f_0010": {"fact_id": "f_0010", "text": "这两天挪到隔壁里侧空座（具体哪天未定）", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [1, 2], "evidence_quotes": ["我这两天挪到你隔壁里侧那个空座", "里侧安静多了，上午政治背完两章"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 21:16", "valid_to": "2026-11-10 12:40", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 21:16", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "这两天挪到隔壁里侧空座（具体哪天未定）", "valid_to": "2026-11-10 12:40", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [2], "quote": "里侧安静多了，上午政治背完两章"}]}, "f_0011": {"fact_id": "f_0011", "text": "她上午在里侧座位背完政治两章，比窗边快", "subject": "HER", "relation": "学习进度", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["里侧安静多了，上午政治背完两章，比窗边快"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-10 上午", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 12:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 12:40", "history": []}, "f_0012": {"fact_id": "f_0012", "text": "她昨晚背到一点", "subject": "HER", "relation": "作息", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["昨晚背到一点"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-09 夜", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 12:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 12:40", "history": []}, "f_0013": {"fact_id": "f_0013", "text": "舍友阿荞已保研", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "舍友", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["舍友阿荞保研的人了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 12:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 12:40", "history": []}, "f_0014": {"fact_id": "f_0014", "text": "阿荞在群里问她复习进度，她觉得烦", "subject": "HER", "relation": "舍友", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["还在群里问我进度，烦"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 12:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 12:40", "history": []}, "f_0015": {"fact_id": "f_0015", "text": "她妈今天第三次打电话问复习情况，她答“挺好的”", "subject": "HER", "relation": "家里", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["我妈今天第三次打电话问复习得怎么样，我说挺好的，挂了。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-11", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 19:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 19:40", "history": []}, "f_0016": {"fact_id": "f_0016", "text": "她没敢把一模分数告诉她妈", "subject": "HER", "relation": "家里", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["其实一模那个分我还没敢跟她说。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-11", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 19:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 19:40", "history": []}, "f_0017": {"fact_id": "f_0017", "text": "她说明天要按在座位上背一整天，让他别管", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["明天你别管我，我把自己按在座位上背一整天。"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 19:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 19:40", "history": []}, "f_0018": {"fact_id": "f_0018", "text": "她说到初试英语真题还剩八套没刷，政治大题一个字没写", "subject": "HER", "relation": "复习进度", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["英语真题还剩八套没刷，政治大题一个字没写"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-12", "valid_from": "2026-11-12 08:15", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-12 08:15", "history": []}, "f_0019": {"fact_id": "f_0019", "text": "她要求他说复盘法的第一步第二步，今晚照做", "subject": "HER", "relation": "请求与安排", "evidence_uids": [6, 7], "evidence_quotes": ["就说你那个复盘法，第一步干嘛第二步干嘛，今晚我就照做", "复盘法今晚试了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "completed", "event_time": "2026-11-12", "valid_from": "2026-11-12 08:15", "valid_to": "2026-11-12 21:58", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-12 08:15", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "她要求他说复盘法的第一步第二步，今晚照做", "valid_to": "2026-11-12 21:58", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [7], "quote": "复盘法今晚试了"}]}, "f_0020": {"fact_id": "f_0020", "text": "她今晚试了复盘法，错题只记关键词，比抄整页快，明天接着用", "subject": "HER", "relation": "复盘法试用反馈", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["复盘法今晚试了，错题只记关键词，比抄整页快多了，明天接着用。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-12 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-12 21:58", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-12 21:58", "history": []}, "f_0021": {"fact_id": "f_0021", "text": "老关通知这周六自习室消防检查闭馆一天", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "自习室通知", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["老关通知这周六自习室消防检查闭馆一天"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "本周六", "valid_from": "2026-11-12 21:58", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-12 21:58", "history": []}, "f_0022": {"fact_id": "f_0022", "text": "市图书馆周六要抢座", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "场所情况", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["市图书馆那天要抢座"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "本周六", "valid_from": "2026-11-12 21:58", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-12 21:58", "history": []}, "f_0023": {"fact_id": "f_0023", "text": "她周六若没别的去处，就抱着政治去快餐店坐着", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [8, 9], "evidence_quotes": ["没有我就抱着政治去快餐店坐着", "快餐店打卡"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-12 21:58", "valid_to": "2026-11-14 10:28", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-12 21:58", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "她周六若没别的去处，就抱着政治去快餐店坐着", "valid_to": "2026-11-14 10:28", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [9], "quote": "快餐店打卡"}]}, "f_0024": {"fact_id": "f_0024", "text": "她今天在快餐店刷完一套英语阅读", "subject": "HER", "relation": "自习进度", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["我居然也刷完一套英语阅读"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14 上午", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 10:28", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 10:28", "history": []}, "f_0025": {"fact_id": "f_0025", "text": "模考群里有人晒分英语阅读全对，她盯着那条消息看了十分钟", "subject": "HER", "relation": "模考群晒分", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["模考群里有人晒分，英语阅读全对，我盯着那条消息看了十分钟。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-15 22:07", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 22:20", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 22:20", "history": []}, "f_0026": {"fact_id": "f_0026", "text": "她提出让他陪过政治大题的坑，随即收回，说自己背、不用他管", "subject": "HER", "relation": "政治大题复习", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["算了算了，你别管我，我自己能行，我自己背。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-15 22:10", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 22:20", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 22:20", "history": []}, "f_0027": {"fact_id": "f_0027", "text": "她提过想让他晚上陪着过一遍政治大题的坑，随后自己收回", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["要不晚上你陪我过一遍政治大题的坑？"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 22:20", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 22:20", "history": []}, "f_0028": {"fact_id": "f_0028", "text": "她说周日说完“别管我”就后悔了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "情绪坦白", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["周日那天说完'别管我'我就后悔了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-15", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 09:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 09:35", "history": []}, "f_0029": {"fact_id": "f_0029", "text": "她上午先把大题高频前五列出来，下午刷真题第四套", "subject": "HER", "relation": "当日安排", "evidence_uids": [13], "evidence_quotes": ["上午先把大题高频前五列出来，下午刷真题第四套"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 09:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 09:35", "history": []}, "f_0030": {"fact_id": "f_0030", "text": "她手机上的群全禁言，只留研友群和我", "subject": "HER", "relation": "当前状态", "evidence_uids": [13], "evidence_quotes": ["手机上群全禁言了，就留研友群和你"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 09:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 09:35", "history": []}, "f_0031": {"fact_id": "f_0031", "text": "她说带背第十九天，上午在里侧座位背书，效率回来了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "复习进度", "evidence_uids": [14], "evidence_quotes": ["带背第十九天，上午在里侧座位背书，效率回来了。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18 上午", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:15", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:15", "history": []}, "f_0032": {"fact_id": "f_0032", "text": "她约今晚十点连麦二十分钟，随机抽她三页大题，由我念页码她背、卡壳处圈出，九点五十五她打微信", "subject": "HER", "relation": "约定", "evidence_uids": [15], "evidence_quotes": ["今晚十点你有没有二十分钟？连麦随机抽我三页大题，你念页码我背，卡壳的地方圈出来。九点五十五我打你微信。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18 22:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:15", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:15", "history": []}, "f_0033": {"fact_id": "f_0033", "text": "她今晚背到矛盾的特殊性那段突然想哭", "subject": "HER", "relation": "状态", "evidence_uids": [16], "evidence_quotes": ["刚才背到矛盾的特殊性那段突然想哭"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19 夜", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 22:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 22:35", "history": []}, "f_0034": {"fact_id": "f_0034", "text": "她连着十天没歇过", "subject": "HER", "relation": "状态", "evidence_uids": [16], "evidence_quotes": ["可能连着十天没歇过"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 22:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 22:35", "history": []}, "f_0035": {"fact_id": "f_0035", "text": "她闹钟定了十一点睡，明早照旧", "subject": "HER", "relation": "作息安排", "evidence_uids": [17], "evidence_quotes": ["闹钟定了十一点睡，明早照旧"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19 23:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 22:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 22:35", "history": []}, "f_0036": {"fact_id": "f_0036", "text": "她二模九点开考英语", "subject": "HER", "relation": "考试安排", "evidence_uids": [18, 19], "evidence_quotes": ["我二模，九点开考英语", "二模英语阅读错了三个"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "completed", "event_time": "2026-11-21 09:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 08:40", "valid_to": "2026-11-22 20:55", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 08:40", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "她二模九点开考英语", "valid_to": "2026-11-22 20:55", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [19], "quote": "二模英语阅读错了三个"}]}, "f_0037": {"fact_id": "f_0037", "text": "她把手机交给冯其琛保管，十一点喊她交卷", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "托付安排", "evidence_uids": [18], "evidence_quotes": ["手机交你保管，十一点喊我交卷"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21 11:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 08:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 08:40", "history": []}, "f_0038": {"fact_id": "f_0038", "text": "她二模英语阅读错三个，比一模少一半", "subject": "HER", "relation": "二模成绩", "evidence_uids": [19], "evidence_quotes": ["二模英语阅读错了三个，比一模少一半"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-22", "valid_from": "2026-11-22 20:55", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-22 20:55", "history": []}, "f_0039": {"fact_id": "f_0039", "text": "她把复盘改成每晚九点半，雷打不动", "subject": "HER", "relation": "复习安排", "evidence_uids": [19], "evidence_quotes": ["复盘改成每晚九点半雷打不动"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-22 20:55", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-22 20:55", "history": []}, "f_0040": {"fact_id": "f_0040", "text": "窗外那条路昨天开始铺沥青，下周完工", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "窗外道路施工", "evidence_uids": [20], "evidence_quotes": ["窗外那条路昨天开始铺沥青，说下周完工"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21起，预计下周完工", "valid_from": "2026-11-22 20:55", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-22 20:55", "history": []}, "f_0041": {"fact_id": "f_0041", "text": "初试完那晚她请我吃她学校食堂二楼的小炒，她已说定", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "约定", "evidence_uids": [20], "evidence_quotes": ["初试完那晚我请你吃我们学校食堂二楼的小炒，说定了啊"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "初试结束当晚（具体日期未定）", "valid_from": "2026-11-22 20:55", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-22 20:55", "history": []}}, "fact_seq": 41, "updates": [{"fact_id": "f_0010", "action": "complete", "text": "这两天挪到隔壁里侧空座（具体哪天未定）", "old_text": "这两天挪到隔壁里侧空座（具体哪天未定）", "ts": "2026-11-10 12:40", "src_uids": [2], "quote": "里侧安静多了，上午政治背完两章"}, {"fact_id": "f_0019", "action": "complete", "text": "她要求他说复盘法的第一步第二步，今晚照做", "old_text": "她要求他说复盘法的第一步第二步，今晚照做", "ts": "2026-11-12 21:58", "src_uids": [7], "quote": "复盘法今晚试了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0023", "action": "complete", "text": "她周六若没别的去处，就抱着政治去快餐店坐着", "old_text": "她周六若没别的去处，就抱着政治去快餐店坐着", "ts": "2026-11-14 10:28", "src_uids": [9], "quote": "快餐店打卡"}, {"fact_id": "f_0036", "action": "complete", "text": "她二模九点开考英语", "old_text": "她二模九点开考英语", "ts": "2026-11-22 20:55", "src_uids": [19], "quote": "二模英语阅读错了三个"}]}, "plan_items": [], "seed_fids": {"kbin:me": "f_0001", "kbin:her": "f_0002", "kbin:warmth": "f_0003", "kbin:style": "f_0004", "persona:me": "f_0005", "persona:her": "f_0006"}}